entityDescription:
SI Consulting is an Italian company who works in the railway field on national and international client.
We have 20 years of experience on the market and just recently we opened a new branch in Prague for an ESA project.
We are preferred supply for Italcertifer (Italian Notified Body) and recently we started a cooperation with VUZ (Czech Notified Body) on an international project.

In detail Si Consulting offers services in the following fields:

- Verification and Validation of the railway signalling system according to CENELEC norms of design of safety systems ( i.e. schematic plans of signalling systems, signals and balises positioning, Interlocking routes, etc.);
- Risk Analysis of railway scenarios (example of activities: risk comparison for all Italian tunnels and all Italian Level crossing supporting mitigation choices and investment priorities);
- Safety Integrity Level&rdquo; (SIL) identification; identification of the integrity level according to a target individual risk (example of activity: lower SIL demonstration for signalling in railway lines with low traffic density);
- Electrical Power dimensioning of Railway Feeding System (Electrical Substations, catenary, power consumprions, etc.);
- Signalling system and timetable design;

Si Consulting has developed many simulators we use for support to Italian and international railways:

- RAILNET is a railway traffic able to simulate train traffic in critical nodes taking into account of block sections and routes in stations; we are optimizing the design of the ERTMS High density system for the main Italian nodes (Rome, Florence and Milan) according to the assigned timetable;
- MOTORS is a power supply and train consumption simulator; we have supported the design of the AC Italian High speed line power system an of many DC lines, metro and also international rail line;
- SICTR is a train driving simulator developed for RFI to test the impact on the driver of a new signalling system is now used in many training centre for train drivers;
- SIGLO is a risk management tools developed and used for RFI. 
Si Consulting can sell its simulators or provide simulations results depending on the client needs. 
Si Consulting has developed a monitoring system for the integrity of the long welded rail based on measuring devices installed along the track and a center posto collecting data via local WIFI and GSMR transmission.
Si Consulting developed also a Tracking device for locomotives, railway wagons and swap bodies.

